OL,3,GNEWSAFavourite trees sought for
OL,4,AGuernsey art project
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been asked to name their
OL,7,Ffavourite trees in Guernsey as part of
OL,8,Fnew art installation.
OL,10,FAs part of its forthcoming exhibition
OL,11,FGuernsey's Iconic Trees, Art for
OL,12,FGuernsey has invited people to send in
OL,13,Fphotographs of trees that may have
OL,14,Fpersonal significance to them.
OL,16,FIt said, in addition to the photos,
OL,17,Fpeople were being encouraged to send a
OL,18,Fclose-up photograph of one of its
OL,19,Fleaves and the story behind it.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
