OL,3,GNEWSAFavourite trees sought for
OL,4,AGuernsey art project
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnce the submissions had been received,
OL,7,Fit said French artist Anna van der Hoek
OL,8,Fwould create an original linocut of the
OL,9,Ftree, to be added to a growing
OL,10,Fleporello - an accordion-like,
OL,11,Fnever-ending artist's book.
